abstract: >-
  CAP is a governance-first wire protocol for distributed AI agent control
  planes. It integrates identity, budgets, policy mediation, worker capacity,
  pointer-based state separation, lifecycle semantics, and workflows.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - distributed systems
  - governance
  - security
  - protocol
